  "bio": "Diego Roriz is a tattoo artist renowned for his impeccable minimalist styles that resonate with the contemporary trends in tattoo artistry. Situated in the vibrant city of Fortaleza, Brazil, Diego maintains an unparalleled standard of cleanliness, ensuring that every client's experience is not only artistically fulfilling but also in a meticulously hygienic environment. His studio's reputation is built upon this fundamental principle, attracting tattoo enthusiasts who prioritize a clean and safe tattooing experience.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Fortaleza, Ceara, Brazil",
